/** @page ncursesreleasenotes Release Notes

    @section ncurses_2_0_0 ncurses Module Version 2.0.0
    Complete redesign with a modern, thread-safe API built for Qore 2.3.

    @subsection ncurses_2_0_0_binary C++ binary module (ncurses)
    - @c Session: terminal lifecycle, color management, cursor control, input
      injection
    - @c Window: drawing (text, ANSI SGR, box, lines, fill), input events with
      timeout/polling, wrap modes, sub-windows
    - @c Panel: z-order stacking with show/hide/top/bottom/move
    - @c TestTerminal: PTY-based pseudo-terminal for headless automated tests
    - @c Ansi: parse, wrap, measure, and strip ANSI SGR escape sequences
    - style system: <tt>{fg, bg, attrs}</tt> hashes with @c Color and @c Attr
      enums
    - thread-safe: module-level recursive lock with lock-releasing input polling
    - interrupt and sandbox compliance (@c QDOM_TERMINAL_IO, filesystem checks)

    @subsection ncurses_2_0_0_ui NcursesUi toolkit module (22 widget classes)
    - @c Widget base class with parent-child tree, geometry, focus, dirty-flag
      propagation
    - @c BoxLayout (vertical/horizontal) and @c SplitLayout (ratio/fixed) layout
      managers
    - @c EventDispatcher: typed event routing with modal stack and mouse
      hit-testing
    - @c Application: session management, event loop, tick callbacks, modal
      stack
    - @c PanelWidget: floating overlays backed by ncurses panels
    - @c ListWidget: selectable scrollable list with keyboard and mouse support
    - @c TextInputWidget: single-line text editing with cursor and history
    - @c ScrollableWidget + @c LineListContent: viewport with scrollbar
      rendering
    - @c MenuBarWidget + @c DropdownMenuWidget: horizontal menus with Alt+key
      hotkeys and underlined hotkey indicators
    - @c StatusBarWidget: styled left/right-aligned status segments
    - @c DialogWidget: modal dialogs with configurable buttons
      (confirm/error/custom)
    - @c FileBrowserWidget: split-pane file browser with directory listing and
      preview
    - @c ComboBoxWidget, @c CheckboxWidget, @c RadioGroupWidget, @c TableWidget
    - @c FocusManager: Tab/Shift+Tab focus traversal
    - @c TestHarness: @c TestTerminal + @c Session wrapper for widget testing
    - @c TerminalText: Unicode-aware display-width measurement, grapheme-safe
      clipping, and right padding for aligned terminal output

    @subsection ncurses_2_0_0_repl_ui NcursesReplUi helper module
    - @c InputBuffer: text buffer with cursor tracking and Emacs-style editing
    - @c History: command history with up/down navigation
    - @c LayoutCalc: REPL layout dimension calculation
    - @c ScrollCalc: bottom-anchored scroll position helpers

    @subsection ncurses_2_0_0_qrepl qrepl — full-screen ncurses REPL
    - @c Application + @c BoxLayout root layout (menu bar, output, status bar)
    - @c ScrollableWidget output pane with ANSI color rendering
    - inline input editing with @c InputBuffer and @c History
    - @c MenuBarWidget with Alt+key hotkeys (File, Edit, View, Help)
    - @c StatusBarWidget with live status, line count, and timer segments
    - output capture via @c File::getPipe() and a background reader thread
    - modal dialogs: exit confirmation, file browser, animated About with a
      180-frame spinning Qore coin

    @subsection ncurses_2_0_0_build Build and test
    - CMake build system
    - Doxygen documentation with mainpage overviews, code examples, and
      cross-references for all three module layers
    - 9 test suites with 290+ automated test cases

    @section ncurses_1_0 ncurses Module Version 1.0
    - initial release
*/
